# Bodies in the terrain of a 4096x4096 world, with a target of four
# blocks in memory and a check every 60 ticks, as terrain_walk. Five wood
# boxes drop onto the ground left of the spawn and come to rest, two on
# the others. The camera walks two blocks to the right: the blocks with
# the boxes leave memory, and the boxes with them, saved with their
# blocks in the memory store. It walks back, the boxes come back where
# they lay, and the tool digs through one of them, which breaks in two.
# The trace pins the bodies' saves, their return and the freezing of
# bodies that may reach a block not in memory. Cells come and go with
# their blocks, so this replay is not checked for conservation.
